      "review_summary": "The PR wires Signal inbound messages into the shared status-reaction lifecycle, forwards hidden tool and compaction callbacks, documents Signal support, and adds focused config/schema/test coverage including queued emoji overrides.\n\nPR surface: Source +216, Tests +972, Docs +19, Generated 0. Total +1207 across 12 files.\n\nReproducibility: yes. source-level: current main's Signal inbound dispatch lacks status-reaction controller wiring, and the PR body reports a live after-fix Signal run with visible lifecycle reactions plus HTTP 200/201 delivery logs.",
